Elder: The well's carving points toward the old ruins, just as I feared.
You: Could the second Mystic Ylang-Ylang be there?
Elder: It may be. Those stones were made to warn us when the guardian was disturbed.
Elder: You helped our villagers when we needed it. Now I can give you a useful lead.
Elder: Follow the direction of the carving, and stay close to Litik.
You: Dakal a salamat.
[end_timeline]
